[[Image:Is transmut.gif|right|Transmutation]]

Spells from the '''transmutation''' [[spell school]] transform the recipient, either subtly or otherwise.

'''Prohibited school:''' [[conjuration]]<br />
'''Prohibited to:''' conjurers

Specializing in this school brings the notable (in multiplayer) consequence of being unable to use ''[[raise dead]]'' and ''[[resurrection]]'' scrolls.

== Spells ==

The transmutation spells are the following, organized by [[innate level]].
Since [[wizard]]s have a greater interest in spell schools than other classes (because they can specialize in a school), spells that are not wizard spells are ''in italics''.

